    "body": "Hmm, why are the code examples wrapped in `<pre>…</pre>` and not `<pre><code>…</code></pre>`?\r\n\r\n<https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/grouping-content.html#the-pre-element> says:\r\n\r\n> To represent a block of computer code, the `pre` element can be used with a `code` element\r\n\r\n…and an example follows.\r\n\r\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "reactions": {
      "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/whatwg/html/issues/comments/307928785/reactions",
      "total_count": 0,
